---
// Hero.astro — The Statement & The Valve (Rozdzielacz B2B)
---

<section class="w-full min-h-[90svh] flex flex-col justify-between pt-36 pb-0 bg-white">
  
  <!-- Deklaracja celowa -->
  <div class="max-w-[1600px] w-full mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 mb-20">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-kh-black animate-ping"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-kh-muted font-bold">
        Architektura Przesyłu Cieczy &middot; Bydgoszcz
      </span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-[13vw] sm:text-[11vw] lg:text-[9.5rem] leading-[0.9] tracking-tightest text-kh-black uppercase select-none mb-8">
      Przesył<br/>Cieczy.
    </h1>

    <p class="font-sans text-lg sm:text-2xl text-kh-muted max-w-3xl leading-relaxed font-light">
      Inżynieria doboru i dystrybucja armatury. Zabezpieczamy ciągłość pracy dla wielkoobszarowego rolnictwa oraz przemysłowych myjni bezdotykowych.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Mechaniczne Strumienie (The Valve - Dwie Bramy) -->
  <div id="platformy" class="w-full border-t-2 border-kh-black flex flex-col">
    
    <!-- PASMO 01: AGRO / RURAPE.PL -->
    <a 
      href="https://rurape.pl" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group block w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-20 border-b border-kh-border hover:bg-kh-agro hover:text-white kh-transition"
    >
      <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-8">
        
        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-60 mb-2 block">
            [ 01 / Magistrale Rolnicze ]
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-6xl tracking-tight uppercase">
            RURAPE.PL
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 max-w-md font-mono text-xs opacity-80 leading-relaxed hidden md:block">
          Atestowane rury PE100 i PE100-RC. Kompleksowe zaopatrzenie w systemy irygacyjne dla sadów i plantacji.
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Przejdź do katalogu</span>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 border border-current rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-45 kh-transition">
            <span>&nearr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- PASMO 02: MYJNIE / SERCEMYJNI.PL -->
    <a 
      href="https://sercemyjni.pl" 
      target="_blank" 
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="group block w-full px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-20 hover:bg-kh-wash hover:text-white kh-transition"
    >
      <div class="max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-8">
        
        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase opacity-60 mb-2 block">
            [ 02 / Wysokie Ciśnienie 200 Bar ]
          </span>
          <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-6xl tracking-tight uppercase">
            SERCEMYJNI.PL
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1 max-w-md font-mono text-xs opacity-80 leading-relaxed hidden md:block">
          Przemysłowe pompy nurnikowe Udor, komponenty ceramiczne i armatura do ciągłej pracy 24/7.
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between lg:justify-end gap-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Otwórz ofertę pomp</span>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 border border-current rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-45 kh-transition">
            <span>&nearr;</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </a>

  </div>

</section>